        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Upgrades:</strong> 2</p><hr /><p>This tactical @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.equipment.Item.Armored Coat] is both fashionable and practical. While wearing this armor, you gain a +1 item bonus to Stealth checks to [[/act sneak]] and [[/act hide]] in urban environments.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Distracting Double</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> (concentrate, illusion, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You swirl the bottom hem of the trench coat, which creates a temporary illusory double of you in your space. @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.actions.Item.Create a Diversion] with a +2 item bonus to your Deception check. You then Sneak. The DC to disbelieve the illusory double is 20, and the illusion lasts 1 minute.</p>"
